    "long_instructions": "## Generate and Judge Project\r\n\r\n1. Apply feedback and ideas you received from the Rubric Reviewer Bot or your custom bot.\r\n\r\n2. Before you write your final statement, open your AI Audit Field Notes. Choose the three findings that most support your position. Your final statement should be grounded in those findings.\r\n\r\n3. Add your final statement about using AI. Include:\r\n   - Things AI can help with or do for you\r\n   - What the audience should consider when using AI\r\n   - Reasons why following the guidance is important\r\n\r\nYou can use this sentence frame:\r\n\r\n> AI can _ _ _ _ as long as _ _ _ _, because _ _ _ _.\r\n\r\n3. Refine your project. \r\n",
